4_7863538524918513822_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HkK4igwBAEkQ7kNvwFFYCTR&_nc_oc=AdmInzARQd50C7PagKhxGWoktcLLgtTwyNbQcvX3WwAHzVYSZ6sCNJFmJd9I2qCHRYY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyqbmc24QLHVumUPTWCj_lcl_AN0Z4JKACDSvLZ3ANbEA&oe=69BD2E7D"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440-screenshot (30).png", "id": "1144667879939297", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1144667883272630_6614204905845258840_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=47yCGXWAD5YQ7kNvwFR9jUN&_nc_oc=AdmgFjQkMhLEyinn_dsjt-H0Z3bq02EU7i9IRgutEuV5b4f3gwfICdbmZ9sWnRAFM4A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyfXgl7AwFRs9C7ua3Fo1WyC8A3GPxTGBPKF5EXcn-FfA&oe=69BD3CBD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Driven", "keywords": ["racing", "arcade", "simulation", "immersive", "action"], "long_description": "# Immersive first person racing on the Meta Quest 2 & 3.\n\n- Compete against AI to gain credits to purchase cars and gain access to races. Win the race to be added to the Global Leaderboards.\n\n- Take part in Time Trials - navigate obstacles and get the fastest time on the Global Leaderboard.\n\n- Challenging Race Series - take part in a number of races to win the Race Series - 30 Race Series in total\n\n- Over 200 races to complete\n- Over  30 cars to collect\n- Multiplayer \n- Freeroam\n\nDriven is a physics-based \"simcade\" racing game incorporating realistic car-handling and aerodynamics.\n\n- Virtual steering and automatic or manual transmission.\n\n- 3 AI difficulty levels - extra credits awarded for racing against Pro AI & Reckless AI\n\nUpdated graphics for Quest 3\n\n- Damage feature\n\nTake to the track and have fun!", "short_description": "Immersive first person racing on the Meta Quest 2 & 3\n\nCompete against AI to gain credits to purchase cars and gain access to over 200 races. Win the race to be added to Global Leaderboards\n\nTake part in Time Tri